ltac2:(KReplay.run1 (kr_t_PeUResize1 ()) ["WithHeap"; "Call"] "h02KSh11lp;1p;2p-1p10000p4p710p8g000Gj11Tg000gj20Tg0027#1R0f1R1f0R2'0X10X00P1P2O2X10X00P1P2O2X10W0o"). Qed.

